Hello Thaly,

Thank you for your quick reply.
It is nice to implement the cpufreq driver.

Your ZFx86 CPU is based on Cx486DX2 and it supports
a suspend-on-halt feature which is same as Geode CPU. 
I can get PCI IDs, so I write down the code.

There is a patch for recent 2.6 series kernel. 

Please try it!

After boot-up, please do 'modprobe gx-suspmod'.

